# The Python minor version the checked-in hidden tests were generated with.
#
# `random.Random`'s sequence methods are not stable across minor versions, so a
# regeneration on a different one produces different (still valid) tests and
# `problems:gen --check` would report a difference that means nothing.
#
# `npm run problems:gen --check` refuses to run on any other minor, and CI's
# generator lane pins this one (ROADMAP P2-14).
3.14
